                <li>Understand the philosophical roots of Vedic astrology</li>
                <li>Learn the difference between Jyotish and Western astrology</li>
                <li>Discover how karma and reincarnation connect to planetary positions</li>
                <li>Master the concept of time cycles (Yugas, Mahadashas)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="aps-learning-section">
              <h4>12 Rashis (Zodiac Signs) Deep Dive</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>Core personality traits of each sign</li>
                <li>Elemental energies (Fire, Earth, Air, Water)</li>
