                <li>Simple remedies for planetary afflictions</li>
                <li>Rituals to enhance positive planetary influences</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FDF8E8 0%, transparent 100%); padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 32px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-family:var(--font-heading);"><strong>"By the end of this book, you'll be able to read birth charts with confidence and understand the cosmic mathematics behind your life's journey."</strong></p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="aps-tab-content" data-tab-content="author">
      <h3>About the Author</h3>
      <div class="aps-metafield-content">
        <div class="aps-author-info">
          <div class="aps-author-image">
            {%- if section.settings.author_image != blank -%}
              {{
                section.settings.author_image
                | image_url: width: 480
                | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'aps-author-image-tag', alt: 'Gurudev Sunil Vashist'
              }}
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="aps-author-image-placeholder">SV</div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <div class="aps-author-details">
            <h4>Gurudev Sunil Vashist</h4>
            <p>Teaching people the science of Astrology for more than 2 decades, Gurudev Sunil Vashist is a seasoned astrologer and the master of various astrological practices like Vedic Astrology, Lal Kitab Astrology, Palmistry, Vastu, and many more.</p>
            <p>18 years ago, Gurudev established "Astro Pathshala" with the aim of providing high-quality astrological education to every person who wishes to understand the secrets hidden in the planets and stars with the help of the ancient science of Jyotish.</p>
            <p>With the vision of providing affordable education to all and making people aware of the secrets hidden among the planetary positions in their horoscopes, he is continuously working towards building a large community of students and teachers to help them expand their knowledge about the world of Astrology.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="aps-tab-content" data-tab-content="instructions">
      <h3>How to Access Your E-Book</h3>
      <div class="aps-metafield-content">
        {%- assign instructions = product.metafields.custom.instructions -%}
        {%- if instructions != blank -%}
          {{ instructions }}
        {%- else -%}
          <p>Getting your copy of "Jyotish: The Science of Soul and Karmic Mathematics" is simple and instant:</p>
          
          <div class="aps-steps">
            <div class="aps-step">
              <div class="step-number">1</div>
              <div class="step-content">
                <h4>Complete Purchase</h4>
                <p>Add the e-book to your cart and complete the secure checkout process</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="aps-step">
              <div class="step-number">2</div>
              <div class="step-content">
                <h4>Instant Download</h4>
                <p>Immediately after payment confirmation, you'll receive a download link on the order confirmation page</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="aps-step">
              <div class="step-number">3</div>
              <div class="step-content">
                <h4>Email Delivery</h4>
                <p>A download link will also be sent to your registered email address within minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="aps-step">
              <div class="step-number">4</div>
              <div class="step-content">
                <h4>Start Reading</h4>
                <p>Download the PDF file and open with any PDF reader on your device</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="aps-device-compatibility">
            <h4>Compatible Devices:</h4>
            <div class="device-icons">
              <span>iPhone & iPad</span>
              <span>Android Phones & Tablets</span>
              <span>Windows & Mac Computers</span>
              <span>Kindle (Send to Kindle)</span>
              <span>Any PDF Reader</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div style="background: var(--cream); padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 24px;">
            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--saffron);"><strong>Note:</strong> This is a digital product (PDF). No physical delivery. Purchase ke baad aap ise turant apne phone, tablet, ya laptop par download kar sakte hain.</p>
          </div>
          
          <h4 style="margin-top: 28px;">Need Help?</h4>
          <p>If you don't receive your download link within 10 minutes of purchase, please contact our support team at <strong>support@astropathshala.com</strong> with your order number, and we'll assist you immediately.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  {%- if section.settings.show_reviews -%}
    <div class="aps-product-reviews">
      <h3 class="aps-reviews-title">What Readers Are Saying</h3>
      <div class="aps-reviews-grid">
        {%- assign review_metafield = product.metafields.custom.reviews -%}
        {%- if review_metafield != blank and review_metafield.value != blank and review_metafield.value.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for review in review_metafield.value -%}
            <div class="aps-review-card">
              <div class="aps-review-stars">
                {%- assign rating = review.rating | default: 5 -%}
                {%- assign full_stars = rating | floor -%}
                {%- for i in (1..full_stars) -%}★{%- endfor -%}
                {%- assign empty_stars = 5 | minus: full_stars -%}
                {%- for i in (1..empty_stars) -%}☆{%- endfor -%}
              </div>
              <p class="aps-review-text">"{{ review.content | default: review.text | default: 'This book transformed my understanding of Jyotish. The concept of Karmic Mathematics is brilliant!' }}"</p>
              <div class="aps-review-author">— {{ review.author | default: 'Verified Reader' }}</div>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="aps-review-card">
            <div class="aps-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="aps-review-text">"Finally, a book that explains Jyotish as a logical science! The Karmic Mathematics approach makes so much sense. Every beginner must read this."</p>
            <div class="aps-review-author">— Dr. Amit Patel, Pune</div>
          </div>
          <div class="aps-review-card">
            <div class="aps-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="aps-review-text">"I've been studying astrology for years, but this book gave me a completely new perspective. The chapter on Gunas and planetary nature is eye-opening."</p>
            <div class="aps-review-author">— Neha Gupta, Mumbai</div>
          </div>
          <div class="aps-review-card">
            <div class="aps-review-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="aps-review-text">"Simple language, deep concepts. Perfect for anyone wanting to understand their birth chart. Highly recommended!"</p>
            <div class="aps-review-author">— Rajiv Mehta, Bangalore</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  
  {%- if section.settings.show_faqs -%}
    <div class="aps-product-faqs">
      <h3 class="aps-faqs-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
      <div class="aps-faqs-accordion">
        <div class="aps-faq-item">
          <button class="aps-faq-question">Is this book suitable for absolute beginners?</button>
          <div class="aps-faq-answer">Absolutely! This book is designed for both beginners and intermediate learners. The concepts are explained in simple, easy-to-understand language with practical examples. Even if you have no prior knowledge of astrology, you'll be able to grasp the fundamentals and start reading birth charts by the end.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aps-faq-item">
          <button class="aps-faq-question">What makes this book different from other astrology books?</button>
          <div class="aps-faq-answer">This book presents Jyotish as "Karmic Mathematics" — a logical, systematic approach to understanding destiny. Rather than just predictions, it focuses on the mathematical precision of planetary movements and their mathematical relationship to karma. It combines ancient wisdom with modern analytical thinking.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aps-faq-item">
          <button class="aps-faq-question">What language is the e-book written in?</button>
          <div class="aps-faq-answer">The e-book is written in a unique blend of Hindi and English, making it accessible to a wide range of readers. Technical terms are explained in both languages, and the concepts are presented in a way that transcends language barriers.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aps-faq-item">
          <button class="aps-faq-question">Can I read this on my mobile phone?</button>
          <div class="aps-faq-answer">Yes! The e-book is in PDF format, which can be read on any smartphone, tablet, laptop, or computer. You can also use apps like Google Play Books, Apple Books, or any PDF reader to access the content.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aps-faq-item">
          <button class="aps-faq-question">How will I receive the e-book after purchase?</button>
          <div class="aps-faq-answer">Immediately after payment confirmation, you'll receive a download link on the order confirmation page. A download link will also be sent to your registered email address within minutes. You can download the PDF file instantly and start reading.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  
  <div class="aps-product-certification">
    <div class="aps-certification-badges">
      <div class="aps-cert-badge">
        <span class="cert-icon">✓</span>
        <span class="cert-text">Expert Authored</span>
      </div>
      <div class="aps-cert-badge">
        <span class="cert-icon">{{ 'icon-info.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
        <span class="cert-text">Karmic Mathematics</span>
      </div>
      <div class="aps-cert-badge">
        <span class="cert-icon">{{ 'icon-star.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
        <span class="cert-text">Vedic Wisdom</span>
      </div>
      <div class="aps-cert-badge">
        <span class="cert-icon">{{ 'icon-star.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
        <span class="cert-text">Best Seller</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="aps-sticky-cart">
  <div class="aps-sticky-cart-container">
    <div class="aps-sticky-cart-info">
      <span class="aps-sticky-title">ज्योतिष: Science of Soul</span>
      <span class="aps-sticky-price">{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}</span>
    </div>
    <button class="aps-sticky-add-btn" id="sticky-add-btn">
      Add to Cart
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
:root {
  --ivory: #FFFDF5;
  --black: #1A1208;
  --gold: #B8860B;
  --saffron: #D4860A;
  --gold-lt: #C9A84C;
  --gold-pale: #F5E6C8;
  --cream: #FDF8E8;
  --border: #E8D48A;
  --muted: #7A6535;
}

.aps-product {
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 40px 24px;
  background:transparent;
  font-family:var(--font-body);
}

.aps-product-container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.aps-product-gallery {
  position: sticky;
  top: 100px;
}

.aps-product-gallery-main {
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--cream);
}

.aps-product-gallery-slide {
  display: none;
